    "A teleprompter that follows your voice, with captions and posting to all your networks." : {
      "comment" : "1.1 Welcome: the line under the title, what Cue does (the text follows the voice, captions, posting to every social network from one place)",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
