    "Keep how you clean up, set the sound and zoom: pauses, music level, Studio Voice, punch-ins. Nothing is cut until you tap Remove." : {
      "comment" : "The kit editor's Editing, before anything is kept",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "احتفظ بطريقة تنظيفك وضبطك للصوت والتكبير: التوقفات، مستوى الموسيقى، Studio Voice، الاقتراب. لا يُقص شيء حتى تضغط إزالة."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gem, hvordan du rydder op, indstiller lyden og zoomer: pauser, musikniveau, Studio Voice, punch ins. Intet klippes, før du trykker på Fjern."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Behalte, wie du aufräumst, den Ton einstellst und zoomst: Pausen, Musikpegel, Studio Voice, Punch-ins. Nichts wird geschnitten, bis du auf Entfernen tippst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Guarda cómo limpias, ajustas el sonido y haces zoom: pausas, volumen de la música, Studio Voice, acercamientos. No se corta nada hasta que toques Quitar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Garde ta façon de nettoyer, de régler le son et de zoomer : pauses, niveau de la musique, Studio Voice, zooms secs. Rien n’est coupé avant que tu touches Retirer."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "आप कैसे साफ़ करते हैं, आवाज़ और ज़ूम कैसे सेट करते हैं, उसे रखें: रुकावटें, म्यूज़िक लेवल, Studio Voice, पंच इन। जब तक आप हटाएँ पर टैप न करें, कुछ नहीं कटता।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Simpan cara kamu merapikan, mengatur suara, dan zoom: jeda, level musik, Studio Voice, zoom cepat. Tidak ada yang dipotong sampai kamu ketuk Hapus."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conserva come ripulisci, regoli il suono e lo zoom: pause, livello della musica, Studio Voice, stacchi ravvicinati. Non si taglia nulla finché non tocchi Rimuovi."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "整え方、音とズームの設定を保存：間、音楽の音量、Studio Voice、パンチイン。「削除」をタップするまで何もカットされません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "정리 방식, 소리와 확대 설정을 저장해요: 쉼, 음악 볼륨, Studio Voice, 펀치 인. 제거를 탭할 때까지 아무것도 잘리지 않아요."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Behold hvordan du rydder opp, stiller inn lyden og zoomer: pauser, musikknivå, Studio Voice, innzoominger. Ingenting klippes før du trykker på Fjern."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bewaar hoe je opschoont, het geluid instelt en zoomt: pauzes, muziekniveau, Studio Voice, snelle inzooms. Er wordt niets geknipt tot je op Verwijder tikt."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Guarde como você limpa, ajusta o som e o zoom: pausas, volume da música, Studio Voice, aproximações. Nada é cortado até você tocar em Remover."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spara hur du rensar, ställer in ljudet och zoomar: pauser, musiknivå, Studio Voice, inzoomningar. Inget klipps förrän du trycker på Ta bort."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "เก็บวิธีเก็บงาน ตั้งเสียง และซูมของคุณ: ช่วงหยุด ระดับเพลง Studio Voice การซูมเข้า ไม่มีอะไรถูกตัดจนกว่าคุณจะแตะลบ"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Temizleme, ses ve yakınlaştırma ayarlarını sakla: duraklamalar, müzik seviyesi, Studio Voice, ani yakınlaşmalar. Kaldır'a dokunana kadar hiçbir şey kesilmez."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Giữ cách bạn dọn, chỉnh âm thanh và thu phóng: khoảng ngừng, mức nhạc, Studio Voice, phóng nhanh. Không gì bị cắt cho đến khi bạn chạm Xóa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留你的清理方式、声音和缩放设置：停顿、音乐音量、Studio Voice、快速推近。点按“移除”前不会剪掉任何内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留你的清理方式、聲音和縮放設定：停頓、音樂音量、Studio Voice、快速拉近。點按「移除」前不會剪掉任何內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
