    "Only when you pick Ultra AI: up to 3 requests for a script. Nothing is sent in the background." : {
      "comment" : "What Ultra AI sends › Sent to Anthropic: footer (a script takes up to 3 requests: the draft, the polish and, if it runs long, a fit to length)",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "فقط عندما تختار Ultra AI: حتى 3 طلبات لكل نص. لا يُرسل أي شيء في الخلفية."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
