    "Pauses can’t be found reliably here. Try Edit by text." : {
      "comment" : "Clean Up › Pauses, under “Too much background sound”: the pauses can't be told from the background; Edit by text (the tool's name) still cuts by words",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا يمكن العثور على الوقفات بدقة هنا. جرّب التعديل بالنص."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
