    "Recorded in %@ at %lld fps · This camera can’t do %@ at %lld fps" : {
      "comment" : "Toast after a take when the camera recorded in a smaller format than the one chosen (e.g. 'Recorded in 1080p at 60 fps · This camera can’t do 4K at 60 fps'); said once per format per session",
