    "The draft between writing steps, for the polish and, if it runs long, to fit it to length" : {
      "comment" : "What Ultra AI sends › Sent to Anthropic: a row (the draft goes back for the polish and, only when the script runs past the platform's length, once more to shorten it)",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "المسودة بين خطوات الكتابة، للتحسين، ولضبط طولها إذا طالت"
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Udkastet mellem skrivetrinene, til finpudsningen og, hvis det bliver for langt, for at tilpasse længden"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
