    "Too loud together · the preview may distort, the video won’t" : {
      "comment" : "Editor › Volume panel, orange note: the edit's sounds (voice, music, voice-over) together go over full scale. The preview plays them without a limiter and may crackle; the exported video goes through Cue's limiter and doesn't distort.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
