    "You can change it later in Sound, on the support’s bar." : {
      "comment" : "Message when a video with sound is added as the second part of a split screen (a 'support'): its sound is changed later with the Sound button on that support's toolbar. 'Sound' must match the toolbar button's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يمكنك تغييره لاحقًا من «الصوت» في شريط الفيديو المساند."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kan ændre det senere under Lyd på støttevideoens bjælke."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kannst es später unter Ton in der Leiste des Zusatzvideos ändern."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puedes cambiarlo luego en Sonido, en la barra del video de apoyo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous pourrez le modifier plus tard dans Son, sur la barre de la vidéo d’appui."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "आप इसे बाद में सहायक वीडियो की बार में ध्वनि से बदल सकते हैं।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kamu bisa mengubahnya nanti di Suara, pada bilah video pendukung."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puoi cambiarlo dopo in Audio, nella barra del video di supporto."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
