    "Apple Intelligence can’t draft in it yet" : {
      "comment" : "Grey line under a language's name in a menu (Language & Region › Script Language, the Translate tool's targets): Apple Intelligence doesn't write that language. No final full stop, like the Voice Following menu's lines.",
