    "Moved %@ back to meet the one before · the speech didn’t change" : {
      "comment" : "Undoable toast after Close gap: the support moved earlier by a duration so it starts where the previous one ends; the creator's speech isn't touched",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
