    "One small travel mistake can cost you a whole day. Here’s how to avoid it." : {
      "comment" : "Find inspiration: a starter idea's opening line, a first sentence the creator could say to camera",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "خطأ صغير في السفر قد يكلفك يومًا كاملًا. إليك كيف تتجنبه."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En lille rejsefejl kan koste dig en hel dag. Sådan undgår du den."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
