    "Starts at %@ · only %@ of room · move the playhead back for more" : {
      "comment" : "Place note of Add photo or video in warning color, when under 3 s are left from the playhead to the video's end or the next support: where it starts (\"00:22.8\"), then how much room there is (\"1.6s\")",
