    "Strong swearing and slurs are never written. Apple Intelligence won’t generate them." : {
      "comment" : "My Cue Voice (Apple Intelligence plan) No dashes in any language.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا تُكتب الشتائم القوية والإهانات أبدًا، فـ Apple Intelligence لن يولّدها."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Grove bandeord og skældsord skrives aldrig. Apple Intelligence genererer dem ikke."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Starke Flüche und Beleidigungen kommen nie vor: Apple Intelligence erzeugt sie nicht."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nunca se escriben malas palabras fuertes ni insultos: Apple Intelligence no los genera."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les jurons violents et les insultes ne sont jamais écrits : Apple Intelligence ne les génère pas."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "तेज़ गालियाँ और अपमानजनक शब्द कभी नहीं लिखे जाते; Apple Intelligence इन्हें नहीं बनाता।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Umpatan kasar dan hinaan tidak pernah ditulis. Apple Intelligence tidak akan membuatnya."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Parolacce pesanti e insulti non vengono mai scritti: Apple Intelligence non li genera."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "強い悪態や差別的な言葉は書きません。Apple Intelligenceが生成しないためです。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "심한 욕설과 비하 표현은 쓰지 않아요. Apple Intelligence가 생성하지 않아요."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Grove banneord og skjellsord skrives aldri. Apple Intelligence genererer dem ikke."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zware scheldwoorden en beledigingen worden nooit geschreven: Apple Intelligence genereert ze niet."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Palavrões pesados e ofensas nunca são escritos: a Apple Intelligence não os gera."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Grova svordomar och glåpord skrivs aldrig. Apple Intelligence genererar dem inte."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "คำหยาบรุนแรงและคำดูหมิ่นจะไม่ถูกเขียน เพราะ Apple Intelligence ไม่สร้างคำเหล่านี้"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ağır küfürler ve hakaretler asla yazılmaz; Apple Intelligence bunları üretmez."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lời chửi thề nặng và lời xúc phạm không bao giờ được viết: Apple Intelligence sẽ không tạo ra chúng."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "严重的脏话和侮辱性词语绝不会被写出。Apple Intelligence 不会生成它们。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "嚴重的髒話和侮辱性詞語絕不會寫出來，因為 Apple Intelligence 不會產生這類內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
