    "There are a lot of flight myths out there. Let’s sort them out." : {
      "comment" : "Find inspiration: a starter idea's opening line, a first sentence the creator could say to camera",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "هناك الكثير من الخرافات عن تذاكر الطيران. لنوضحها."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der findes mange myter om flybilletter. Lad os rydde op i dem."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es gibt viele Mythen rund ums Fliegen. Bringen wir Ordnung rein."
          }
